# Safe Deploy Script Mandatory for GREEN

## Rule
All production deploys to GREEN (68.183.168.75) MUST use:
  /opt/clinical-sovereignty-lab/scripts/safe_deploy.sh <service>

## Forbidden patterns
- Inline `ssh root@68.183.168.75 "docker compose ..."` from Mac terminal
- Direct `docker compose -f docker-compose.prod.yml ...` on GREEN console
- Any deploy that skips the pre/post vault count guard
- Hand-copying files to GREEN via scp; use git pull on GREEN instead

## Required pattern
ssh root@68.183.168.75 "cd /opt/clinical-sovereignty-lab && git pull origin main && bash scripts/safe_deploy.sh <service>"

Single command, single SSH invocation, single repository state, single guarded deploy step.

## Why
2026-05-12 vault wipe traced to manual deploy bypassing safety wrapper. Inline SSH with --force-recreate caused 28-day data loss for 26 clients.
